            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yenimam eyaŋaunit ŋes okek loka ewema loka airiamunun, ainakin ŋes araun ainakinet mama ejai EJAKAIT koiŋaren kewema lokalaunan loka EJAKAIT: imarakinio aokot akouke; kebukoki aokot; egelario ituŋanan ŋin kotuŋake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
