        {
          "text": " Ituŋanan kere yenika ekek loka Isirael, arai yenika imo luiboienenete kayes, yenenyami aokot kere; aluikini eoŋ ituŋanan ŋin yenenyami aokot, agelari ŋes kotuŋake. ",
