              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋes katemaria idwe luka Isirael ebe, Siri idio kayesi kenyam aokot, karaida imoit yeniboienenei kayes ainyam aokot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
